[CENTER][SIZE=6][B]Changelog[/B][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B][[COLOR=#5b9bd5]1.1.0[/COLOR]] - 2026-08-18[/B][/SIZE]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#57bb57][B]» Highlights & Major Features[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Full Dual-Platform Compatibility (Purpur 26.2 & Spigot 26.2):[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Dynamic runtime platform detection ([ICODE]Platform.java[/ICODE]) optimizing performance for Paper/Purpur while guaranteeing 100% crash-free fallback on vanilla Spigot.
  [*]Shaded & relocated Kyori Adventure 5.2.0 library ([ICODE]de.zfzfg.eventplugin.libs.kyori[/ICODE]) for zero-dependency Adventure support on Spigot.
  [*]Universal dual-dispatch bridges for Text ([ICODE]TextUtil[/ICODE]), GUI inventories ([ICODE]GuiUtil[/ICODE]), ItemMeta ([ICODE]ItemUtil[/ICODE]), and Asynchronous Teleportation ([ICODE]TeleportUtil[/ICODE]).
  [*]Isolated Paper Registry helper ([ICODE]PaperRegistryHelper[/ICODE]) preventing ClassNotFound errors on Spigot when resolving 1.21+ [ICODE]EnchantmentTagKeys[/ICODE].
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Complete GUI System Modernization & Legacy Archive:[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Retired and archived 16 legacy GUI classes to [ICODE]old-files/[/ICODE] ([ICODE].java.old[/ICODE]) to eliminate technical debt.
  [*]Introduced [ICODE]LiveTradeBridge[/ICODE] linking command-based challenges directly to the modern, interactive [ICODE]LiveTradeGui[/ICODE].
  [*]Modernized [ICODE]/pvprespond[/ICODE] command handler with direct LiveTrade GUI integration.
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Interactive Chat & SubCommand Unification:[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Interactive click buttons in chat for challenges ([ICODE][► ACCEPT ◄][/ICODE], [ICODE][✖ DENY][/ICODE], [ICODE][📋 OPEN GUI][/ICODE]), spectator invites, and web token copying.
  [*]Unified subcommands ([ICODE]AcceptSubCommand[/ICODE], [ICODE]DenySubCommand[/ICODE], [ICODE]RespondSubCommand[/ICODE]) replacing duplicate legacy alias code paths.
  [*]Centralized full-RGB title, subtitle, and actionbar delivery.
  [/LIST]
[*][B]100% Clean Localization Audit (i18n D1–D11):[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]All 11 detectors report 0 Critical and 0 Warnings.
  [*]Safely pruned 284 dead keys from retired legacy GUIs across all 7 language bundles ([ICODE]de[/ICODE], [ICODE]en[/ICODE], [ICODE]es[/ICODE], [ICODE]fr[/ICODE], [ICODE]ja[/ICODE], [ICODE]pl[/ICODE], [ICODE]ru[/ICODE]) with 100% key parity (815 master keys).
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Deprecation Cleanup under Java 21 LTS:[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Removed [ICODE]bungeecord-chat[/ICODE], migrated [ICODE]ChatColor[/ICODE] to [ICODE]Text[/ICODE] delegates, modernized [ICODE]Attribute.MAX_HEALTH[/ICODE], [ICODE]getRespawnLocation()[/ICODE], [ICODE]URI.create().toURL()[/ICODE], [ICODE]Registry.POTION_EFFECT_TYPE[/ICODE], and native TPS metrics.
  [*]182 passed automated unit and integration tests (100% green).
  [/LIST]
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B][[COLOR=#5b9bd5]1.0.9[/COLOR]] - 2026-08-11[/B][/SIZE]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#57bb57][B]» Added & Highlight Features[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Integrated Inventory Management via InventoryBackup (Required Dependency):[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Replaced legacy snapshot files with [ICODE]InventoryBackup[/ICODE] ([ICODE]InventoryBackup.jar[/ICODE] from InventoryRestore)
  [*]Automatic backups taken before match/event teleports and restored on match/event end, respawn, or rejoin
  [*]Crash-safe [ICODE]inventory-guard.yml[/ICODE] journal ensuring players never lose items across crashes
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Player Location Safety & Stranded Player Protection:[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Synchronously persisted return positions in [ICODE]player-return-locations.yml[/ICODE]
  [*]Automatic return for players stranded in event/arena worlds on join when no match is active
  [*]Unified [ICODE]SafeLocationResolver[/ICODE] preventing void teleports and world unload traps
  [*]New admin rescue command: [ICODE]/eventpvp rescue (list|<player>|clean)[/ICODE]
  [*]Offline payout queue in [ICODE]pending-payouts.yml[/ICODE] for event rewards and wager winnings
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Web Interface Enhancements & Multiverse World Management:[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Full Multiverse world management from the web panel (create, import, load, unload, delete with safety checks, and backup/restore)
  [*]Dedicated 3-tab Inventory Manager (Backup Explorer, Minecraft Canvas inventory & XP renderer, 2-stage restores, live guard monitor)
  [*]Server Resource Pack item texture integration via [ICODE]ResourcePackTextureService[/ICODE]
  [*]Dynamic Server Material & Enchantment catalog via [ICODE]/api/materials[/ICODE]
  [*]Deep-snapshot dirty-state tracking ([ICODE]CONFIG_BASELINE[/ICODE] & [ICODE]isDeepEqual[/ICODE]) eliminating false-positive unsaved change flags
  [*]Configurable Public URL with transparent [ICODE]:{port}[/ICODE] binding for dynamic [ICODE]/eventpvp webtoken[/ICODE] resolution
  [*]Pre-save safety confirmation warning dialog before changing the web server port
  [*]Rate limiting protection against token brute-force and restore abuse
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Zero Hardcoded Messages & True i18n Localization:[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]100% key parity across all 7 language bundles (1097 keys per [ICODE]messages_*.yml[/ICODE], 764 keys per [ICODE]web/lang/*.json[/ICODE])
  [*]Fully localized console and logger output across all 7 languages via [ICODE]messages.console.*[/ICODE]
  [*]Embedded resource default fallback system preventing raw key displays on partial translation files
  [*]Automated quality & localization test suite ([ICODE]tools/i18n_audit.py[/ICODE]) with 0 findings across rules D1–D11
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Streamlined Debug Mode & World Management Switches:[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Persistent 3-state debug system: [ICODE]/eventpvp debug (on | on full | off | status)[/ICODE] saved to [ICODE]settings.debug[/ICODE]
  [*]Decoupled world loading into [ICODE]settings.world-management.events[/ICODE] and [ICODE]settings.world-management.arenas[/ICODE]
  [*]Automatic config migration rewriting obsolete 1.0.8 settings in place on first start
  [/LIST]
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#e8a838][B]» Changed & Removed[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Hard Dependencies:[/B] [ICODE]Multiverse-Core[/ICODE] (v4 or v5) and [ICODE]InventoryBackup[/ICODE] are now mandatory in [ICODE]plugin.yml[/ICODE] alongside [ICODE]Vault[/ICODE]
[*][B]Removed Command:[/B] [ICODE]/inventoryrestore[/ICODE] and permissions [ICODE]eventpvp.inventory.restore*[/ICODE] (replaced by [ICODE]/inv <player>[/ICODE] and Web Panel)
[*][B]New Permissions:[/B] [ICODE]eventpvp.admin.web[/ICODE], [ICODE]eventpvp.debug[/ICODE], [ICODE]eventpvp.debug.receive[/ICODE], [ICODE]pvpwager.spectate.all[/ICODE], [ICODE]pvpwager.nowager[/ICODE]
[/LIST]

